  "name": "Furry Vietnam Eternity",
  "shortName": "FUVE",
  "description": "Furry Vietnam Eternity (FUVE) is an annual Vietnamese furry convention in Ho Chi Minh City, organized by the Vietnamese furry community, with Alasky and Mỏng as organizers. It is the country's largest pioneering furry gathering, bringing together furries from Vietnam and neighboring regions, and aims to welcome non-furry attendees too. The first FUVE was held December 18, 2022, and it has encouraged other furry events in Vietnam such as FurGIV in Hanoi. Attendance has grown from 150 to 450 in 2026.",
